— 🇸🇦/🇾🇪 NEW: Yemen’s Armed Forces say Saudi warplanes carried out 156 air and missile strikes over the past 24 hours against what they described as civilian sites in Sanaa, Taiz, Saada, Al-Jawf, Marib and Amran.

According to the statement, F-15 and Typhoon aircraft operated from Khamis Mushait and Taif, while missile attacks were launched from Najran and Jizan. The group says the total number of Saudi air and missile strikes since the latest escalation began has reached 1,798.

